---
title: Welcome
layout: base.njk
eleventyNavigation:
    key: Home
    order: 1
---

<section id="welcome" class="relative pt-40 pb-24 px-8 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto editorial-grid">
        <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 z-10">
            <h1 class="font-headline font-extrabold text-[3.5rem] leading-[1.1] text-on-surface tracking-tight mb-8">
                    Welcome to the <br>
                <span class="text-primary italic">DLF Virtual Forum</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl leading-relaxed mb-10">
                    The DLF Forum is a dynamic gathering place for GLAM professionals to share ideas, sustain critical work, and spark innovation. It connects library, archives, and museum practitioners, as well as other knowledge workers, through <strong>intentional community building</strong> and <strong>collaborative exchange</strong>.
                </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                {% if metadata.registration_url %}
                    <a href="{{ metadata.registration_url }}" class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all">Register</a>
                {% endif %}
                {% if metadata.program_url %}
                    <a href="{{ metadata.program_url }}" class="bg-surface-container-high text-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-surface-container-highest transition-colors">Explore Program</a>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 relative mt-12 lg:mt-0">
            <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl rotate-3 bg-surface-container">
                <img alt="Library and museum professionals collaborating at a shared digital workspace with large screens and archival materials." class="w-full h-full object-cover" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="1400" loading="eager" src="{{ '/static/samantha-borges-ax3lbQfdXP0-unsplash.webp' }}" width="933">
            </div>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-8 -left-8 w-48 h-48 rounded-full bg-primary/10 opacity-60 blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="core-values" class="py-24 bg-surface-container-low">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-stretch">
            <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-surface-container-lowest p-10 md:p-12 rounded-[2rem] shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <span class="font-label text-primary font-bold tracking-widest text-xs uppercase">Join the DLF Forum</span>
                    <h2 class="font-headline font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl text-on-surface mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-tight">
                        Step into the gathering where the DLF community meets, shares, and shapes what comes next.
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mt-6 max-w-3xl">
                        <a class="underline" href="https://www.diglib.org/about/dlf/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DLF</a> programs stretch across the full year, but the Forum is our signature event: a place to conduct community business, exchange professional practice, and help assess DLF programs with direct community input.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-8">
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold text-sm">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">diversity_3</span>
                            Libraries, archives, and museums
                        </span>
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-bold text-sm">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">public</span>
                            Academic, nonprofit, and government organizations
                        </span>
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed text-on-tertiary-fixed font-bold text-sm">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">build</span>
                            Librarians, technologists, curators, and service providers
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4">
                    {% if metadata.registration_url %}
                    <a href="{{ metadata.registration_url }}" class="button-primary">Register for the Forum</a>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if metadata.program_url %}
                    <a href="{{ metadata.program_url }}" class="button-secondary">Explore the program</a>
                    {% endif %}
                    <a href="https://www.diglib.org/about/code-of-conduct/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button-ghost">
                        Read the Code of Conduct
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">arrow_outward</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-primary text-on-primary min-h-[28rem]">
                <img
                    alt="Digital library and museum practitioners collaborating around a shared table."
                    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover mix-blend-multiply opacity-35"
                    decoding="async"
                    loading="lazy"
                    src="{{ '/static/collaborative-workspace.png' }}">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary via-primary-container/90 to-info/80"></div>
                <div class="relative p-10 md:p-12 h-full flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <span class="font-label font-bold tracking-widest text-xs uppercase text-on-primary/90">Why People Show Up</span>
                        <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-3xl mt-3 max-w-sm">The Forum works as three spaces at once.</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-on-primary/12 backdrop-blur-sm p-5 border border-on-primary/15">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">groups</span>
                                <p class="font-headline font-bold text-xl">A Meeting Place</p>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-on-primary">Working groups and community members gather to conduct business and present work in progress.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-on-primary/12 backdrop-blur-sm p-5 border border-on-primary/15">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">storefront</span>
                                <p class="font-headline font-bold text-xl">A Marketplace</p>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-on-primary">Practitioners trade practical knowledge, field-tested ideas, and professional experience.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-on-primary/12 backdrop-blur-sm p-5 border border-on-primary/15">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">forum</span>
                                <p class="font-headline font-bold text-xl">A Congress</p>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-on-primary">The wider community reviews DLF programs and helps assess what should happen next.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lg:col-span-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-secondary-fixed p-8 rounded-[1.75rem]">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed-dim flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-secondary-fixed" aria-hidden="true">badge</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-2xl text-on-secondary-fixed mb-3">A broad practitioner mix</h3>
                    <p class="text-on-secondary-fixed-variant leading-relaxed">
                        The Forum welcomes librarians, developers, technologists, curators, project managers, administrators, and more.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-tertiary-fixed p-8 rounded-[1.75rem]">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-tertiary-fixed" aria-hidden="true">language</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-2xl text-on-tertiary-fixed mb-3">A genuinely international room</h3>
                    <p class="text-on-tertiary-fixed-variant leading-relaxed">
                        Participants come from academic, nonprofit, and government organizations around the world.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-surface-container-highest p-8 rounded-[1.75rem] border border-outline-variant/15">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-accent-soft flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-accent" aria-hidden="true">shield</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-2xl text-on-surface mb-3">An inclusive space by design</h3>
                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                        Every participant is expected to uphold the DLF Code of Conduct and help maintain a harassment-free environment.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

